du destinataire, qui est informé de la source et peut s''opposer dès le premier message."}},{"id":"relevance-unknown","when":{"relevance":["unknown"]},"decision":"manual_only","explain":{"en":"The link between the offer and the recipient''s profession has not been established, so a person must confirm it before sending.","fr":"Le lien entre l''offre et la profession du destinataire n''est pas établi : une personne doit le confirmer avant l''envoi."}}],"requiredElements":["sender_identity","postal_address","opt_out_link","unsubscribe_headers","source_disclosure","relevance","recipient_language","honest_subject"]}'::jsonb, '[{"title":"CNIL — Les règles d''or de la prospection par courrier électronique","url":"https://www.cnil.fr/fr/les-regles-dor-de-la-prospection-par-courrier-electronique-0"},{"title":"Legiscope — RGPD, prospection par email et SMS en B2B (summary)","url":"https://www.legiscope.com/blog/rgpd-marketing-email-sms.html"},{"title":"RFC 8058 — Signaling one-click functionality for List-Unsubscribe","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8058"}]'::jsonb, NULL, true) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
